    "created_at": "2016-11-17T15:37:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-17T15:37:37Z",
    "body": "Right, I'd definitely suggest you create such custom elements to help coders do better validations quicker; that would be a great contribution.\n\nLet's close this, as I don't see it leading to any changes in HTML's already well-established input types, but I'm happy to continue discussing other solutions using today's technology with you in the closed thread.\n",
